    <string name="gem_cascade_help_title">Gem Cascade</string>
    <string name="gem_cascade_help_text">Swap two neighbouring gems, or tap one and then the other, so three or more of the same kind line up. They vanish and new gems fall in, and chains score more. Four in a line makes a Flare, five a Prism, an L or T shape a Burst. Use Hint if you are stuck. Boosters are free but limited in each game.</string>
